  "description": {
    "raw": "An invisible barrier holds back vermin. A vermin with HD of less than one-third your level cannot penetrate the barrier.\n\nA vermin with HD of one-third your level or more can penetrate the barrier if it succeeds on a Will save. Even so, crossing the barrier deals the vermin 2d6 points of damage, and pressing against the barrier causes pain, which deters most vermin.",
    "search_text": "\"an invisible barrier holds back vermin. a vermin with hd of less than one-third your level cannot penetrate the barrier.\\n\\na vermin with hd of one-third your level or more can penetrate the barrier if it succeeds on a will save. even so, crossing the barrier deals the vermin 2d6 points of damage, and pressing against the barrier causes pain, which deters most vermin.\"",
